title: Bed
---
<<declare $bed_state = 0>>

<<if $bed_state == 0>>
    Your very own resting place.
    For some reason, you felt as if it were not the best time to sleep.
    <<set $bed_state = 1>>
<<else>>
    Your bed.
    Would you like to make it?
    -> Yes
        <<make_bed BedApartment>>
        You made your bed swiftly.
        It felt nice.
    -> No
<<endif>>
===
